      "side": 1,
      "message": "I reconstruct this pointer in `CCallbacks`, from the `handle` returned by the C Code.\nI should be the same as `Arc::as_ptr()`, but with respect to the documentation `https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/sync/struct.Arc.html#method.from_raw`, It looks needed to use `Arc::into_raw()` here.",
