      "writtenOn": "2024-12-13T18:34:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah yep, I see, `CCallbacks::unwrap_client` is converting it back to an `Arc`. The `CCallbacks` effectively owns the `Arc`, so you shouldn\u0027t be calling `from_raw` here as that will cause it to be dropped before the `CCallbacks` is. You should instead have `Drop` implementation on `CCallbacks` that converts `handle` back to an `Arc` and drops it.",
      "parentUuid": "ac58f9a7_40545850",
      "revId": "3705b877691b4e0babfcf50d5d48e81cce6d95c5",
